  "body": "Please disregard previous price guides - the vendors instructions are clear that this property is to be sold and that they would like to consider all serious interest in the property.\r\n\r\nSet on a sunny road front 835sqm (appox) freehold title site sits this immaculate home and income only moments away from beautiful Rothesay Bay Beach. The property offers elevated sea views, a superb sun aspect, outdoor living space and comprises a total of 5 bedrooms and 4 bathrooms including the minor dwelling.\r\n\r\nIn the main home there is a well appointed kitchen with plenty of storage and superb interconnect to the spacious living area and dining area which flows to the outdoor balcony. A fabulous master bedroom complete with spacious wardrobe. A spacious second lounge downstairs is ideal for kids, teenagers or extended family to utilise. In total the main home offers four bedrooms including a semi self contained room downstairs.\r\n\r\nThe income component of the property comprises one bedroom, a bathroom and a well appointed kitchen, living and dining area. \r\n\r\nGreat school zones and in close proximity to great local cafes and shops.\r\n\r\nProperties of this size, in this location are rare and hard to come by, don't miss this opportunity to secure this prime offering.\r\n\r\nDeadline Sale - Thursday 3rd December 2026 at 4pm (unless sold prior)",
